			'500 g onions, in thick slices',
			'400 g carrots, in thick rounds',
			'800 g small waxy potatoes, whole or halved',
			'3 tomatoes, thickly sliced',
			'2 sweet peppers, in wide strips',
			'6 garlic cloves, unpeeled',
