			'Render the fat in a heavy lidded pot, then sear the meat hard until every face is brown and the base of the pot is sticky.',
			'Build the layers in order without stirring: onion, carrot, tomato, pepper, garlic, then potatoes on top, seasoning each layer with salt, cumin, coriander and pepper as you go, and add no liquid at all.',
			'Cap the pot with overlapping cabbage leaves, tucking their edges down the sides so they seal the food in like a lid inside the lid.',
